<div class="acct-hero"><div><span>DOUBLE-ENTRY LEDGER</span><h2>Accounts & Ledger</h2><p>Track subscription receivables, payments, revenue, cash/bank balances and manual adjustments with balanced debit/credit journals.</p></div><div class="acct-equation"><small>Accounting Equation</small><b>Assets = Liabilities + Equity</b><span>Posted journals only</span></div></div>
